":"collection","title":"Swami","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/underline(_:pattern:color:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/underline(_:pattern:color:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"underline"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"pattern"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4TextV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Text"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4TextV9LineStyleV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"LineStyle"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4TextV9LineStyleV7PatternV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Pattern"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"color"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI5ColorV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Color"},{"kind":"text","text":"?) -> "},{"ki